<title>SINGAPORE: Jurong Cement first half net up 17.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Jurong Cement first half net up 17.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   11.79  vs  10.00</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)     27.00  vs  23.00</p>
<p>    Turnover		     72.13  vs  65.79</p>
<p>    Other income		  1.11  vs   0.97</p>
<p>    Pretax			 15.75  vs  12.73</p>
<p>    Associates		    0.14  vs   0.75</p>
<p>    Tax			     4.10  vs   3.48</p>
<p>NOTE- Full name of company is Jurong Cement Ltd.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
